<Slide
    style={{
        width: '1280px',
        height: '720px',
        background: '#FAF7F2',
        flexDirection: 'column',
        paddingTop: 20,
        paddingBottom: 20,
        paddingLeft: 64,
        paddingRight: 64,
        position: 'relative',
    }}
>
    {/* ── zona A ── */}
    <Box style={{ height: 110, justifyContent: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Text
            style={{
                fontSize: 34,
                fontWeight: 'bold',
                color: '#2A2333',
                lineHeight: 1.3,
                fontFamily: 'Trebuchet MS',
            }}
        >
            The core problem
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 6, background: '#51277C', marginTop: 12 }} />
    </Box>

    {/* ── zona B ── */}
    <Box
        style={{
            height: 530,
            position: 'relative',
            flexDirection: 'column',
            justifyContent: 'center',
        }}
    >
        {/* ikon dokumen di belakang */}
        <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 30, left: 430, opacity: 0.09 }}>
            <svg width={300} height={300} viewBox='0 0 300 300'>
                <rect
                    x='70'
                    y='18'
                    width='160'
                    height='200'
                    rx='10'
                    fill='none'
                    stroke='#51277C'
                    strokeWidth='7'
                />
                <line x1='100' y1='62' x2='200' y2='62' stroke='#51277C' strokeWidth='7' />
                <line x1='100' y1='96' x2='200' y2='96' stroke='#51277C' strokeWidth='7' />
                <line x1='100' y1='130' x2='170' y2='130' stroke='#51277C' strokeWidth='7' />
                <rect x='104' y='176' width='92' height='70' rx='10' fill='#51277C' />
                <path
                    d='M120 176 v-14 a30 30 0 0 1 60 0 v14'
                    fill='none'
                    stroke='#51277C'
                    strokeWidth='9'
                />
            </svg>
        </Box>

        {/* kalimat inti */}
        <Box style={{ position: 'relative', zIndex: 1, alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text
                style={{
                    fontSize: 64,
                    fontWeight: 'bold',
                    color: '#2A2333',
                    lineHeight: 1.05,
                    textAlign: 'center',
                    fontFamily: 'Trebuchet MS',
                }}
            >
                A shared obligation,
                <br />
                in a private document.
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 96, height: 7, background: '#AFC440', marginTop: 32 }} />
        </Box>

        {/* dua belahan masalah */}
        <Box
            style={{
                position: 'relative',
                zIndex: 1,
                flexDirection: 'row',
                gap: 20,
                marginTop: 40,
            }}
        >
            <Box
                style={{
                    flex: 1,
                    background: '#FFFFFF',
                    borderRadius: 10,
                    paddingTop: 20,
                    paddingBottom: 20,
                    paddingLeft: 22,
                    paddingRight: 22,
                    boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)',
                    borderTop: '3px solid #51277C',
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                }}
            >
                <Text
                    style={{
                        fontSize: 19,
                        fontWeight: 'bold',
                        color: '#51277C',
                        fontFamily: 'Trebuchet MS',
                    }}
                >
                    The read half
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#6B6478', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                    Parents had no reliable way to know their turn. Closing it means authentication —
                    each family sees only its own child’s class — and a per-class data model.
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box
                style={{
                    flex: 1,
                    background: 'rgba(81,39,124,0.06)',
                    borderRadius: 10,
                    paddingTop: 20,
                    paddingBottom: 20,
                    paddingLeft: 22,
                    paddingRight: 22,
                    borderTop: '3px solid #F3B26C',
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                }}
            >
                <Text
                    style={{
                        fontSize: 19,
                        fontWeight: 'bold',
                        color: '#c4762a',
                        fontFamily: 'Trebuchet MS',
                    }}
                >
                    The write half
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#6B6478', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                    One admin could not maintain six classes. Closing it means a delegated role with
                    a hard boundary, plus a lock/publish gate.
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* penutup */}
        <Box
            style={{
                position: 'relative',
                zIndex: 1,
                marginTop: 28,
                flexDirection: 'row',
                alignItems: 'center',
                gap: 14,
                background: '#FFFFFF',
                borderRadius: 10,
                paddingTop: 16,
                paddingBottom: 16,
                paddingLeft: 22,
                paddingRight: 22,
                boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)',
            }}
        >
            <Text
                style={{
                    fontSize: 16,
                    color: '#51277C',
                    fontWeight: 'bold',
                    fontFamily: 'Trebuchet MS',
                }}
            >
                Why the obvious fix fails
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 22, background: 'rgba(81,39,124,0.24)' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#6B6478', flex: 1 }}>
                A shared spreadsheet has no notion of who may edit which class, no published state,
                and no claim record — so “who has never taken a turn” stays unanswerable.
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* ── zona C ── */}
    <Box
        style={{
            height: 40,
            flexDirection: 'row',
            justifyContent: 'space-between',
            alignItems: 'center',
        }}
    >
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B6478' }}>
            Pizza Snack Play · Visualization Project Description
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B6478' }}>07 / 16</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
